==Release information==
The 064/P-A print of this card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 7 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Rayquaza ex Drop Event]], which ran from April 30 to May 13, 2025. The 065/P-A print of this card was available through {{DL|Mission (TCG Pocket)|Special Missions 2025}}, which were available from April 30 to May 29, 2025.
